    {"name": "board_read", "description": "Read messages of a topic after a seq (default: after what you already read). "
     "Returns next_after_seq for the follow-up call. mine=true: only what reaches you (addressed to you, your role, "
     "everyone, or replying to you) — what it skips was not for you, so it moves your unread cursor like a plain "
     "read; "
     "open_requests=true: requests their owner has not closed yet (from the start of the topic; a view, cursor "
     "untouched). " + UNTRUSTED.strip(),
     "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "required": ["topic"], "properties": {
