         "mine": {"type": "boolean", "default": False}, "open_requests": {"type": "boolean", "default": False}}}},
    {"name": "board_wait", "description": f"Block up to timeout_s (default {WAIT_DEFAULT}, max {WAIT_MAX}) until another "
     "agent posts after after_seq, then return everything after it. mention (default true for a bridged peer, false "
     "for the primary): wake only on a post that reaches you — addressed to you, your role or everyone, or replying "
     "to you. On timeout returns timed_out=true and resume_after_seq — call again, or stop and post your final "
     "answer. "
     f"Budget: {B.WAIT_BUDGET} waits per session (a refused call does not count). " + UNTRUSTED.strip(),
     "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "required": ["topic"], "properties": {
